installed." and "Install with the A button." until Vita3K is installed, then "Installed." and "Remove with the X
button.", set again at start, after an install and after a remove. Your games says "Mark them for Steam and press X to
play.", Settings "Screen, game and controller settings" and Log "This app's log file.". The Settings pane's Picture tab
is called Screen (its settings are unchanged). The wiki's chapter says so.

