Fixed. The tests' session teardown takes the tooltip filter off the app and collects the leftover widgets while the
app is whole, as core's tests do since 06-11-2026: create_app() in test_main_window.py left the filter on, which can
crash pytest's final garbage collection after every test passed. The app's code is unchanged.

