Release 5.4.0.

Changelog: 06-11-2026 00:58:47

Release 5.3.0.

Changelog: 06-11-2026 00:27:29

Fixed. Vita3K's library window no longer stays in sight beside a game (owner, 05-11-2026: with a TV attached it
stayed on the Ally's screen while the game ran on the TV): Vita3K always opens it, and the play mode minimizes it as
soon as the game's window is up, without taking the focus from the game, and again if Vita3K shows it again. It stays
open, so View, LB and RB close it with the game. The wiki's Vita3K chapter says so.

Changelog: 05-11-2026 23:26:51

Fixed. View, LB and RB held now close Vita3K at once (owner, 05-11-2026): Vita3K asked "Do you really want to exit?"
on the close, with No as its default, so the play mode waited out its ten seconds and ended Vita3K by force (the
owner's Ally, Lumines, build 4186; build 4269 asks the same). The app turns that question off in Vita3K's window
settings (confirmExitApp=false in portable\gui-configs\CurrentSettings.ini, every other line kept as Vita3K wrote
it), with the settings it sets already: when it opens, before an install, and now also in the play mode before a
game starts, never while Vita3K runs. The wiki says so.

